    \ MUST be consistent with what is used to enforce the\n\
    \ [Action][build.bazel.remote.execution.v2.Action]'s `timeout`. There is no\n\
    \ relationship between the virtual execution duration and the values of\n\
    \ `execution_start_timestamp` and `execution_completed_timestamp`.\n\
